WEBVTT

00:00:14.293 --> 00:00:16.170
LUCIUS:
My Lord?

00:00:16.212 --> 00:00:20.049
Might it be less, uh....

00:00:20.841 --> 00:00:25.137
Might it not be more prudent
to call off this attack...

00:00:25.888 --> 00:00:28.349
...and simply seek the boy yourself?

00:00:28.390 --> 00:00:31.852
VOLDEMORT:
I do not need to seek the boy.

00:00:31.894 --> 00:00:36.273
Before the night is out, he will come to me.
Do you understand?

00:00:38.234 --> 00:00:40.361
Look at me.

00:00:40.402 --> 00:00:44.490
How can you live with yourself, Lucius?

00:00:44.531 --> 00:00:46.283
I don't know.

00:00:48.410 --> 00:00:50.913
Go and find Severus.

00:00:51.538 --> 00:00:53.582
Bring him to me.

00:01:01.590 --> 00:01:03.634
I know where he is.

00:01:13.310 --> 00:01:15.437
OLIVER:
Come on!

00:01:28.867 --> 00:01:30.577
[YELLS]

00:01:35.791 --> 00:01:37.835
[GRUNTING]

00:01:48.262 --> 00:01:50.139
[SPIDERS SQUEAKING]

00:01:55.477 --> 00:01:57.604
BOY:
Crucio!

00:02:03.319 --> 00:02:04.778
HERMIONE:
No!

00:02:50.908 --> 00:02:54.286
SNAPE: You have performed extraordinary
magic with this wand, my Lord...

00:02:54.328 --> 00:02:56.497
...in the last few hours alone.

00:02:56.538 --> 00:02:58.290
VOLDEMORT:
No.

00:02:58.749 --> 00:03:02.169
No, I am extraordinary...

00:03:02.211 --> 00:03:05.964
...but the wand resists me.

00:03:06.006 --> 00:03:09.176
SNAPE:
There is no wand more powerful.

00:03:09.218 --> 00:03:12.179
Ollivander himself has said it.

00:03:12.221 --> 00:03:17.851
Tonight, when the boy comes,
it will not fail you. I am sure of it.

00:03:19.895 --> 00:03:22.731
It answers to you...

00:03:23.565 --> 00:03:25.901
...and you only.

00:03:26.652 --> 00:03:28.153
Does it?

00:03:31.156 --> 00:03:32.699
My Lord?

00:03:34.993 --> 00:03:39.331
The wand, does it truly answer to me?

00:03:41.083 --> 00:03:43.335
You're a clever man, Severus.

00:03:43.377 --> 00:03:45.254
Surely you must know.

00:03:46.964 --> 00:03:50.676
Where does its true loyalty lie?

00:03:51.176 --> 00:03:52.928
SNAPE:
With you...

00:03:53.429 --> 00:03:55.681
...of course, my Lord.

00:03:55.722 --> 00:03:56.932
VOLDEMORT:
The Elder Wand...

00:03:57.724 --> 00:04:03.522
...cannot serve me properly
because I am not its true master.

00:04:04.606 --> 00:04:10.112
The Elder Wand belongs to the wizard
who killed its last owner.

00:04:16.034 --> 00:04:19.705
You killed Dumbledore, Severus.

00:04:20.581 --> 00:04:25.836
While you live,
the Elder Wand cannot truly be mine.

00:04:27.296 --> 00:04:31.049
You've been a good and faithful servant,
Severus...

00:04:31.550 --> 00:04:36.638
...but only I can live forever.

00:04:39.933 --> 00:04:40.976
My Lord--

00:04:44.146 --> 00:04:45.481
[THUDS]

00:04:46.982 --> 00:04:48.775
VOLDEMORT:
Nagini, kill.

00:04:57.618 --> 00:05:00.162
[SNAPE GASPING]

00:05:49.878 --> 00:05:51.838
SNAPE:
Take them.

00:05:53.006 --> 00:05:54.925
Take them.

00:05:55.759 --> 00:05:57.344
Please.

00:05:57.386 --> 00:06:01.098
Give me something. Quickly.
A flask, anything.

00:06:19.408 --> 00:06:20.909
SNAPE:
Take them to the Pensieve.

00:06:24.454 --> 00:06:26.415
Look at me.

00:06:32.170 --> 00:06:34.923
You have your mother's eyes.

00:06:43.015 --> 00:06:44.933
[SIGHS]

